      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِمَارٌ مُكَدَّحٌ</span></b>  <i>An ass much lacerated by the bites
of other asses.</i> (S, K.) A wild ass is termed
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مكدّح</span> because he is lacerated by the bites of
other asses. (A'Obeyd.)

